@startuml SEQ_15_MELIHAT_SERTIFIKAT
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-15: Melihat Sertifikat Sendiri

actor       "Praktikan"          as Praktikan
boundary    "Browser"            as Browser
control     "SertifikatController" as Controller
entity      "Sertifikat Model"   as Model

== Lihat Daftar Sertifikat Sendiri ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Klik menu "Sertifikat Saya"
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /sertifikat-saya
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model      : Query sertifikat milik user
Model --> Controller     : Data sertifikat
Controller --> Browser   : Render halaman daftar sertifikat
Browser    --> Praktikan : Daftar sertifikat\n(tombol Download)

== Download Sertifikat ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Klik "Download" pada sertifikat
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /sertifikat-saya/{sertifikat}/download
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model      : Query sertifikat
Model --> Controller     : Data sertifikat
Controller --> Browser   : Download file sertifikat PDF
Browser    --> Praktikan : File sertifikat PDF diunduh

@enduml